```

str_range = 1, so idx = 0 only. slen = MIN(vallen, sizeof(m->value.s)). The value string is "#! /usr/bin/ruby" (16 chars). slen = 16.

file_strncmp(m->value.s, ms->search.s, 16, flags=w):
- ws = STRING_COMPACT_OPTIONAL_WHITESPACE
- eb = b + strlen(s2) ← strlen on the input buffer! If input has no NUL bytes, strlen reads past the end → heap-buffer-overflow READ.

